#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:171
msgid "关键差异:"
msgstr "Key Differences:"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:173
msgid "**FT1** 使用 GFSK 调制, 不经 Polar 编码, 头部通过 BCH 编码。`mcs_index=8` 表示非编码直通。"
msgstr ""
"**FT1** uses GFSK modulation, bypasses Polar coding, and protects the header"
" with BCH coding. `mcs_index=8` indicates uncoded passthrough."

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:174
msgid "**FT2** 使用 PSK 调制, Polar(64,K) 头部编码, `segment_without_crc` 码块分割。"
msgstr ""
"**FT2** uses PSK modulation, Polar(64,K) header coding, and "
"`segment_without_crc` code block segmentation."

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:175
msgid ""
"**FT3/FT4** 使用 PSK 调制, Polar(256,K) 头部编码, `segment_with_crc` 码块分割 (每段额外附加 "
"CRC)。B 组控制信息 CRC 种子为 `0x555555 ^ LLID`。"
msgstr ""
"**FT3/FT4** use PSK modulation with Polar(256,K) header coding and "
"`segment_with_crc` code-block segmentation (each segment appends an "
"additional CRC). The Group B control information CRC seed is `0x555555 ^ "
"LLID`."

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:177
msgid "硬件对接"
msgstr "Hardware Integration"

#: ../../explanation/architecture.md:179
msgid ""
"`phy.usrp` 模块封装了 USRP E310 (Xilinx Zynq-7020 + AD9361) 的收发接口。在无硬件环境下, "
"`MockUSRP` 提供完整的 UHD API 仿真, 使得收发流程可以离线调试。"
msgstr ""
"The `phy.usrp` module wraps the USRP E310 (Xilinx Zynq-7020 + AD9361) "
"transceiver interface. In environments without hardware, `MockUSRP` provides"
" a full UHD API simulation, enabling offline debugging of the transceiver "
"pipeline."
